### ========== 0) Base ==========
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@riderId = 2
@driverId = 6
@cabId = 7

### ========== 1) Create a PENDING trip ==========
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "riderId": {{riderId}},
  "pickupLocation": "City Center",
  "dropoffLocation": "Centria University"
}

### ✅ 运行后看 Response 里的 data.id，就是 tripId
### 把 tripId 记下来，比如 33

### ========== 2) List pending trips for this driver (excluding rejected) ==========
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/pending?driverId={{driverId}}

### ========== 3) Reject a trip ==========
### 把 33 改成你刚创建出来的 tripId
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/38/reject?driverId={{driverId}}

### ========== 4) List pending again (trip should disappear for this driver) ==========
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/pending?driverId={{driverId}}

### (Optional) Check global pending list (trip still PENDING in system)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/status/PENDING